#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0247 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "Positive control added by PLAN-absent-guard-test-hardening P3: this rule previously had ONLY an expect=skipped fixture, which asserts non-execution and so proved nothing about the rule ever running at this standard/version. Every one of the 26 required TSPARMCD codes is present, so the check is satisfied. This is the fixture that proves the rule EXECUTES here - the skipped-only scenario could not."
#library standard=sendig version=3-0
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 1 | AGEU | v-AGEU
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 2 | SDESIGN | v-SDESIGN
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 3 | DOSDUR | v-DOSDUR
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 4 | EXPENDTC | v-EXPENDTC
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 5 | EXPSTDTC | v-EXPSTDTC
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 6 | GLPTYP | v-GLPTYP
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 7 | ROUTE | v-ROUTE
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 8 | SNDIGVER | v-SNDIGVER
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 9 | SNDCTVER | v-SNDCTVER
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 10 | SPECIES | v-SPECIES
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 11 | SPLRNAM | v-SPLRNAM
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 12 | SPREFID | v-SPREFID
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 13 | SSPONSOR | v-SSPONSOR
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 14 | STCAT | v-STCAT
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 15 | STDIR | v-STDIR
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 16 | STRAIN | v-STRAIN
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 17 | STSTDTC | v-STSTDTC
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 18 | STITLE | v-STITLE
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 19 | SSTYP | v-SSTYP
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 20 | TRT | v-TRT
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 21 | TFCNTRY | v-TFCNTRY
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 22 | TSTFLOC | v-TSTFLOC
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 23 | TSTFNAM | v-TSTFNAM
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 24 | TRMSAC | v-TRMSAC
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 25 | TRTCAS | v-TRTCAS
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 26 | TRTV | v-TRTV
---
